  "description": "A library for managing, validating, and activating software licenses for products developed by Tejarat Fanavaran Sabz.\n      This package provides tools for verifying digital signatures, checking license key integrity, and ensuring compatibility with authorized product versions.\n      Ideal for internal and commercial applications requiring license-based access control.\n\n      Features:\n      - RSA digital signature verification with SHA256\n      - PublicKeyToken validation for trusted assemblies\n      - Compatible with .NET 6 and above\n      - Suitable for backend services and desktop applications\n\n      Note: This package is designed specifically for official products of Tejarat Fanavaran Sabz and is not intended for public use without formal authorization.",
